{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15621","headline":"小苑春望宫池柳色 · 杨凌","name":"小苑春望宫池柳色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上苑闲游早，东风柳色轻。\n储胥遥掩映，池水隔微明。\n春至条偏弱，寒余叶未成。\n和烟变浓淡，转日异阴晴。\n不独芳菲好，还因雨露荣。\n行人望攀折，远翠暮愁生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨凌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15621.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15621","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}